## 1. The architecture I would use

I would use a combination of **DDD + Hexagonal Architecture + Contract-First Architecture + Conformance Testing**.

Not one framework alone.

```text
                    EKS DOMAIN SEMANTICS
                           │
                           ▼
                 LANGUAGE-NEUTRAL CONTRACT
                           │
             ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
